#### 3.4 WithRetryMethodPolicies (Line 391)

**Changes:**
- Primary storage: `o.UnaryOptions.RetryMethodPolicies`
- Backward compatibility: Also stores to `o.RetryMethodPolicies`
- Preserves wildcard configuration in both storage locations

```go
func WithRetryMethodPolicies(mp map[string]retry.Policy) Option {
	return Option{F: func(o *client.Options, di *utils.Slice) {
		if mp == nil {
			return
		}
		di.Push(fmt.Sprintf("WithRetryMethodPolicies(%+v)", mp))
		if o.UnaryOptions.RetryMethodPolicies == nil {
			o.UnaryOptions.RetryMethodPolicies = make(map[string]retry.Policy)
		}
